{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471864",
      "title": "Animating with CSS Animations",
      "sourceHash": "9c84c74253b8eda016f0000a803edf753765b84d190259616f0ebd9945e2fd3a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.96,
          "end": 3.12,
          "en": "Now CSS transitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.12,
          "end": 6.27,
          "en": "as we're using them here to animate this icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.27,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "are nice, but sometimes not enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 12.63,
          "en": "For example, here, if we open this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.63,
          "end": 16.05,
          "en": "it might be nice if we would play a little animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.05,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "As this modal opens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 20.58,
          "en": "maybe it should slide up from the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 23.613,
          "en": "and also fade in whilst it's doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "And this can also still be achieved with just CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "but not with a CSS transition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 35.193,
          "en": "at least not here the way this application is built.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.15,
          "end": 39.57,
          "en": "Because if we take a look at our component code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.57,
          "end": 43.17,
          "en": "and there at the Header.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.17,
          "end": 46.95,
          "en": "we can see that this new challenge component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.95,
          "end": 51.91,
          "en": "which in the end is the component that also uses this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.98,
          "end": 57.33,
          "en": "that this new challenge component in the header file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.33,
          "end": 60.18,
          "en": "is added to the DOM conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 63.543,
          "en": "based on this IsCreatingNewChallenge state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 68.16,
          "en": "So it's not always part of the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.16,
          "end": 69.84,
          "en": "And you can of course also see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.84,
          "end": 72.273,
          "en": "if you inspect this modal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 75.15,
          "en": "there if you inspect the body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.15,
          "end": 78.69,
          "en": "and then this div with the ID modal, you find the backdrop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.69,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "behind the modal and the modal dialogue here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 84.84,
          "en": "but as I close the modal, both are gone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.84,
          "end": 87.63,
          "en": "So they're not part of the DOM at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.63,
          "end": 89.253,
          "en": "if the modal is not open.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.33,
          "end": 94.41,
          "en": "Now, this also means that we can't use a CSS transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.41,
          "end": 96.27000000000001,
          "en": "because we can't transition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.27000000000001,
          "end": 101.16,
          "en": "and animate from any initial value as this modal opens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.16,
          "end": 103.38,
          "en": "because there is no initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.38,
          "end": 106.443,
          "en": "because the modal element is not there right at the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.28,
          "end": 110.03999999999999,
          "en": "But we can still animate it as you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.03999999999999,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "by using another feature that's built into CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 115.443,
          "en": "CSS animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 119.16,
          "en": "The idea behind CSS animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.16,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "is that we define a animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 125.28,
          "en": "so a sequence of steps on our own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.28,
          "end": 129.183,
          "en": "by using the special at key frames syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 133.98,
          "en": "Then you can give your animation any name of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.98,
          "end": 137.043,
          "en": "For example, slide up, fade in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 141.51,
          "en": "and then you have curly braces to define the different steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.51,
          "end": 143.61,
          "en": "your animation should go through.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 147,
          "en": "And this allows you to set an initial state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147,
          "end": 150.63,
          "en": "even if the element was not part of the DOM before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.63,
          "end": 155.63,
          "en": "and an end state and as many in-between states as you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.05,
          "end": 161.57999999999998,
          "en": "You can do this with from and to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 163.68,
          "en": "or with percentage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.68,
          "end": 167.43,
          "en": "So 0% means that will be the state at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.43,
          "end": 170.463,
          "en": "100% means that this will be the end state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 173.73,
          "en": "And then between those curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.73,
          "end": 178.32,
          "en": "that belong to those states, you set up your CSS properties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.32,
          "end": 180.45,
          "en": "So for example, here for the modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.45,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "we might want to push it down a little bit initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 188.523,
          "en": "so that it can slide up as this animation plays.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "We can use the transform property for this again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 197.87,
          "en": "and then use the translateY property to push it down.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.97,
          "end": 202.053,
          "en": "And here we could, for example, push it down by 30 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 206.7,
          "en": "In addition, we might wanna set the opacity to zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 206.7,
          "end": 209.04,
          "en": "so that initially it's invisible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.04,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "even though it's part of the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 213.15,
          "en": "And then we can copy this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 218.15,
          "en": "and set our end state to have a translateY value of zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 218.52,
          "end": 221.55,
          "en": "so that it's not pushed down anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.55,
          "end": 225.873,
          "en": "and an opacity of one so that it's not invisible anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 227.22,
          "end": 231.6,
          "en": "And now with that custom animation defined here in CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 231.6,
          "end": 233.49,
          "en": "we can go to the selector",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 233.49,
          "end": 236.07,
          "en": "where we wanna attach the animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 239.16,
          "en": "so to the elements the animation should be attached to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.16,
          "end": 240.723,
          "en": "in this case, this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.58,
          "end": 246.15,
          "en": "And then use the special animation CSS property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 246.15,
          "end": 248.913,
          "en": "to attach an animation to this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.84,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "And this animation will then automatically be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 257.64300000000003,
          "en": "by CSS whenever this element appears in the DOM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 258.81,
          "end": 261.6,
          "en": "So here we then refer to our animation name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.6,
          "end": 264.873,
          "en": "so this name here in my case of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 266.34,
          "end": 268.38,
          "en": "Then we also set a duration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 268.38,
          "end": 270.51,
          "en": "which of course is again up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 270.51,
          "end": 273.18,
          "en": "also if you want a easing function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 273.18,
          "end": 276.42,
          "en": "And then here I'll also add a special keyword,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 276.42,
          "end": 278.19,
          "en": "forwards, at the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 278.19,
          "end": 281.61,
          "en": "which simply means that I want to keep the end state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 281.61,
          "end": 283.17,
          "en": "once the animation is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 283.17,
          "end": 285.303,
          "en": "So once this duration here is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 288.45,
          "en": "Now you could configure more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.45,
          "end": 291.51,
          "en": "and you can, of course check out the MDN article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 291.51,
          "end": 295.02,
          "en": "on CSS animations if you wanna learn all about them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 295.02,
          "end": 297.18,
          "en": "This of course, is not a CSS course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 297.18,
          "end": 300.9,
          "en": "but these are the most important configuration items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 300.9,
          "end": 304.323,
          "en": "of the CSS animation feature that you wanna be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 305.73,
          "end": 308.58,
          "en": "And with that set, you'll notice that if I go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.58,
          "end": 310.41,
          "en": "and I click add challenge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.41,
          "end": 314.91,
          "en": "now this modal does indeed slide up from the bottom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 314.91,
          "end": 317.253,
          "en": "and fade in whilst doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 318.63,
          "end": 320.58,
          "en": "And that's therefore another way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 320.58,
          "end": 322.95,
          "en": "of animating things you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.95,
          "end": 327.42,
          "en": "Again, using just CSS and with CSS animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 327.42,
          "end": 330.66,
          "en": "and CSS transitions which I showed you before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 330.66,
          "end": 333.69,
          "en": "you have two extremely powerful features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 333.69,
          "end": 336.213,
          "en": "that often might be all you need.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}